{"post_id":30,"title":"Privacy Policy","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","elementor_data":[{"id":"c035a28","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"88","right":"64","bottom":"40","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":20,"column":"20","row":"20","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"9a7b16f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>POLICY</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":13},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":0.18}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"05ce3a5","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Privacy policy","header_size":"h1","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":52},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.035},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.08}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9d105d3","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Last updated [DATE]. This policy covers [YOUR REGISTERED BUSINESS NAME], operating this site.</p>","text_color":"#8E8E93","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":14},"typography_font_weight":"300"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false},{"id":"38612e6","elType":"container","settings":{"container_type":"flex","content_width":"boxed","padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"64","bottom":"88","left":"64","isLinked":false},"gap":{"unit":"px","size":30,"column":"30","row":"30","isLinked":true},"flex_align_items":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"41b423f","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"What we collect","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"f042c69","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>When you buy something: your name, delivery address, email address and phone number. We need these to get a parcel to you and to tell you where it is.</p><p>When you pay: nothing. Card and UPI details go directly to our payment provider, [YOUR PAYMENT GATEWAY]. They never touch our servers and we never see your card number.</p><p>When you subscribe to the letter: your email address, and nothing else.</p><p>When you browse: standard technical data such as your IP address, browser and the pages you visited, collected through cookies and analytics.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"feed7b9","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Why we hold it","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"c0b0d38","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>To fulfil your order, to handle returns and refunds, to answer you when you write to us, to meet tax and accounting obligations under Indian law, and to send you the monthly letter if you asked for it.</p><p>We do not sell your data. We do not share it with anyone except the parties listed below, and only as far as they need it to do their job.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"8d41cef","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Who else sees it","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"9127b4f","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Our courier partners, who get your name, address and phone number so they can deliver. Our payment provider, who handles the transaction. Our hosting provider, where this site runs. Our email provider, if you subscribed. Analytics providers, in aggregated form.</p><p>[LIST YOUR ACTUAL PROVIDERS HERE — e.g. Shiprocket, Razorpay, Hostinger, Google Analytics]</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"cd65ce2","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"How long we keep it","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"15819b4","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Order records for as long as Indian tax law requires us to, which is currently [8] years. Newsletter subscriptions until you unsubscribe. Analytics data for [26] months.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"1e03644","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Your rights","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"e967b16","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, or ask us to delete it. Write to <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a> and we will respond within [30] days. Deletion requests are honoured except where we are legally required to keep a record, such as a tax invoice.</p><p>You can unsubscribe from the letter using the link at the bottom of any of them, and that takes effect immediately.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"3bb00fe","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Cookies","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"1dd11eb","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We use cookies to keep your cart working between pages, to remember you are logged in, and to understand which pages people actually read. You can block cookies in your browser, but the cart will stop working if you do.</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"},{"id":"0ed6ab2","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Contact","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#000000","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":26},"typography_font_weight":"500","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"em","size":-0.02}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"1aa7bb5","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>Questions about any of this go to <a href=\"mailto:support@wabisabivibe.store\">support@wabisabivibe.store</a>, or by post to [YOUR REGISTERED BUSINESS ADDRESS].</p>","text_color":"#595959","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16},"typography_font_weight":"300","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":false}]}
